# Prefactorization-algebra formalization boundary

The former declarations in this module used `True` fields for the local
algebras, inclusions, locality, ground-state/GNS data, localization geometry,
Haag duality, prefactorization maps, and the claimed Schenkel and DHR results.
They did not define those objects or prove the cited theorems, so the
placeholder API has been removed.

The repo currently has separate finite owners for toric-code matrix
calculations and Fibonacci fusion data. Neither establishes an observable net,
Haag duality, a prefactorization algebra, or the DHR classification theorem.
Those claims remain open until the relevant carriers, maps, coherence laws,
and proofs exist in Lean.
-/
